WEBVTT

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:03.640
Welcome!

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:06.320
Table for how many?

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.360
Two please.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.840
Two... Would you mind waiting please?

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:12.530
There isn’t a free table?

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.320
I’m really sorry...

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.160
Excuse me, could we have
some tea please?

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:19.040
Yes, I’ll be right there.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.500
Thanks for your hard work.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.540
Minto, won’t you help as well?

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:29.560
Pardon me... this has always been my job.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.380
Don’t worry! I’m always doing this at home.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.180
What...?

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.900
The world seems to be swaying...

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.190
Bu-Ling-san!

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.630
She’s caught a cold...

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.880
Don’t worry, she’ll be fine if she rests for 2-3 days.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.140
Such a healthy person like her has a cold... how odd.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:10.880
Bu-Ling...

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:14.670
Bu-Ling-san! We have to cool her fever down.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:26.140
Hey Retasu! What are you doing?

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.290
I thought she’d recover faster that way...

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:37.530
You’re overdoing it!

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:45.090
Are you OK, Bu-Ling?

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:46.960
It’d be better for you to get more sleep.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:48.550
I must go...

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:49.340
Eh??

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:51.770
I must go... to pick up...

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:53.970
Bu-Ling!

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.150
Bu-Ling-san!

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:59.720
I have... to go...

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:02.850
Siblings?

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.870
Yes, Bu-Ling has several siblings.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:10.490
“To pick up...” most probably refers to her siblings.

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:13.020
Oh, that’s it... We didn’t know.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:16.160
Bu-Ling can’t go in her condition.

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.950
You girls go on her behalf then.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:32.300
Kindergarten... So that’s what she
meant by “have to pick up.”

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:37.320
But, why does she have to pick up her siblings?

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.880
We’ll find out soon.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.820
That child...

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.190
...looks a lot like Bu-Ling.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.900
Umm, may I help you with something?

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.820
Eh? Bu-Ling is sick?

00:02:58.290 --> 00:03:02.170
It’s just a cold. She’ll be fine if she rests for 2-3 days.

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.220
Oh, that’s a relief.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.830
You seem to know a lot about Bu-Ling.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:08.540
Huh?

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:13.750
We’re always together, but we don’t
know anything about her family.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:17.770
There isn’t much I can tell you...

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:22.180
...but, her mother died a few years ago.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:35.160
...her father, having resolved to be undefeated in any Street Fight or Martial Arts contest,

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:39.130
...travels around the world to improve his martial arts and is mostly not home.

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:46.580
...so Bu-Ling has to do all the housework,
and look after her siblings on her own.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.820
Morning!

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.650
Good morning!

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.640
Please take care of Heicha again today.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:10.480
Take care of me... take care..

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.660
Sure, I will..

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:14.600
Bu-Ling-chan?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.160
Mmm?

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.370
...you’re doing a great job.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.070
What do you mean?

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:24.750
It must be tough... you have school too..

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:30.300
Heicha-chan is still in kindergarten, and
your other brothers are still young.

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.250
Bu-Ling got used to it, so it’s alright!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:40.050
I wonder if that girl is pushing herself too hard...

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:42.100
We had no idea...

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.690
Things have really been hard for Bu-Ling-san.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:53.020
Anyway, today we’ll walk Bu-Ling’s sister home instead.

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:58.980
Good evening.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:02.700
Good evening.

00:05:02.700 --> 00:05:06.790
Heicha-chan, your sister can’t come today.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:09.950
So we’ll go home with you, OK?

00:05:14.260 --> 00:05:15.370
No.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:16.840
Eh?

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:19.060
No! I don’t want to!

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:22.380
Then you won’t be able to go home...

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:28.340
Bu-Ling-oneechan always picks me up...
and told me not to go with strangers!

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:29.900
Yeah, but...

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:34.570
And, she said to keep away from ugly looking old ladies!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:37.820
That’s so typical of Bu-Ling!

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:41.370
You can’t go home alone right?

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:42.750
She’ll come!

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.420
She will come for sure!

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.590
Waah, Sis!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.930
Sorry I’m late!

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:12.320
Are you really alright?

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:16.030
Don’t push yourself too hard, we can walk home with you.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:19.320
It’s ok! I don’t feel that bad.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:19.900
But...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.350
Really, I’m fine!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.830
So you can all go home.

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.540
...can go home!

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:27.920
Let’s go, Heicha...

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:33.260
(Note: “Sensei” used here generally means “Teacher”)

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.880
Goodbye, Sensei...

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.260
Goodbye...

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:37.430
Sis, I’ve been waiting for you...

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.260
We’re home...

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:48.300
Welcome back!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.100
What’s for dinner tonight?

00:06:51.100 --> 00:06:52.860
We’re hungry!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:56.740
Wait a while, I’ll make it now.

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:00.370
Just a sec...

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:03.480
Everyone...?

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:06.000
You haven’t eaten yet, right?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.990
If you don’t mind... we thought, maybe
we could cook with you.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:12.550
You won’t get any better
if you don’t relax.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:20.560
Oh that? Don’t worry, Shirogane gave us
food that will definitely do you good!

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:28.640
It’s OK! Today, we’ll cook.

00:07:28.640 --> 00:07:30.510
You should get some sleep.

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:32.240
But...

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.930
Wah! Great!

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:43.360
tired~ {*_*}

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.110
Let’s eat!

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:53.240
Thanks for the food!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.880
Thanks for your help!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:00.530
No need to thank us. When you’re
in trouble, of course we’ll help!

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:03.670
By the way, we’re not going home yet.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:06.960
Tada!!!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:09.600
I brought my “sleep-over set” with me.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:12.230
This is my first time sleeping over at a friend’s place.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.030
I’m a little excited.

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:17.470
So, where is my bed?

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:24.240
Sorry, but we’re not leaving until your cold is gone.

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:27.160
If there’s anything wrong, tell us. OK?

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:31.040
Ichigo will do whatever she can!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:31.900
Minto will too!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:34.400
Everyone...

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.350
Thank you...

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:44.930
Xie xie...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.860
It’s morning!

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.970
Retasu sure is energetic...

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:07.270
Yeah... Are we really going to do all that?

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:11.730
We have to, otherwise Bu-Ling can’t rest.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:15.690
But won’t we wake her up?

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:19.590
Don’t worry, she has earplugs on.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:26.410
Your sister has a cold, and will be resting today.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.910
We’re replacing her temporarily...

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:32.000
...so let’s work together!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.630
Yesss~! Let’s work together!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.150
Alright! Let’s do our best for Bu-Ling!

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:37.100
YEAH!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:44.350
Yesss~!

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.510
Time for morning sports!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.400
OK!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:49.390
Itadakimasu!

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.110
Now, to tidy up the mess...

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.610
Tough, tough!

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:54.610
Cleaning, cleaning!

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:55.740
Laundry, laundry!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:57.710
I need a break!

00:09:57.120 --> 00:09:58.990
Shopping, shopping!

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.550
Pick up the kids again.

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.530
(...)

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:02.030
Minto, you help too!

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.360
Hey, stop that!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:21.610
How embarrassing...

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:24.660
We didn’t think it would be so tough.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:27.440
Seems impossible to do...

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.120
Until you’re better again, we’ll...

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.190
I’m already better!

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:37.360
After sleeping a whole day, I feel I can do anything!

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.800
I’ve caused you guys lots of trouble...

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.970
But, are you really alright?

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:45.430
I’m really fine!

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:47.750
Thanks a lot for today!

00:10:49.730 --> 00:10:52.290
Well then, don’t push
yourself too hard.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:06.980
Sis, your face looks all red.

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:10.450
Don’t worry, I’m OK.

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:11.440
Bu-Ling-chan!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.690
Sensei, good morning!

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.250
Good morning. How do you feel?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.300
I’m fine...

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:19.610
Your face is red...

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:21.570
...you’re having a fever!

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:28.430
It’s great trying to be strong for your sister, but don’t push yourself too hard.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.830
Yes.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:36.710
Bu-Ling-chan... aren’t you working too hard?

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:41.030
If you’re having a tough time, will you come to me?

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:44.800
Your mom passed away, your dad isn’t home...

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:48.680
...and you’re taking care of both
the house and your siblings.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:53.920
If you feel down, it’s always good to talk to someone...

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.610
Mother...

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:04.770
I’m sorry, Bu-Ling. I’ve been giving
you nothing but trouble.

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:08.000
That’s not true.

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:12.480
...it’s ok as long as you get well soon.

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:14.960
I’m sorry.

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:23.940
From now on, all of you will have to endure a lot...

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:26.880
What I want you to know is,

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:30.390
the secret is to think about the good things and not the sad ones.

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.170
Smile, Bu-Ling!

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:42.400
Your smile alone can make people
happy, didn’t you notice?

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.760
Mum...

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:53.710
It’s not working, I really can’t smile now.

00:12:57.650 --> 00:13:03.160
I love you. Bu-Ling... please take
care of dad and the others.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:09.000
If I can help with anything, please let me know.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:15.500
Thanks, but Bu-Ling is really fine.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.230
Bu-Ling-chan...

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:22.220
Thanks for the lift, please take care of Heicha for me.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:29.430
I see, so you’re a kind-hearted lady huh?

00:13:29.430 --> 00:13:30.160
Huh?

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:36.570
Doing a good deed like sending the
girl home. You have a kind spirit.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.150
Tart, what do you think you’re doing?

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:51.490
It’s all Quiche’s idea.
No one can beat me. Look!

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:52.890
FUSION!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.100
Don’t tell me you’ve hurt Sensei!?

00:13:55.950 --> 00:13:58.090
Sensei! Sensei!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:04.680
I won’t... I won’t forgive you!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:08.890
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.270
Give sensei’s spirits back!

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:42.230
Why are you getting all worked up?
Your face is red too.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.720
Your condition isn’t good anyway. Can you even fight?

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:51.200
You’re just talking big! Will you be OK if that monster isn’t on your side everytime?

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:54.000
You’re really pissing me off!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.450
Speak for yourself!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.640
Bah you impertinent girl! Attack!

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:01.980
(Cock-a-doodle-doo~)

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:05.210
(Bazoo~)

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:11.130
(Chicken fire! kekko)

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:18.660
Haha I was right! She isn’t in good shape today.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:20.600
But that’s kinda no fun.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.740
(Hi hhi ffu)

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:31.780
(Half Boiled~!)

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.750
(Salt’s better than other condiments!)

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.200
(Saturday bargain sale!)

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:42.040
(3 for 50yen!)

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:46.800
Hehe, that was good!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:52.340
...now the finishing blow!

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:56.210
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:03.730
Damn, just a little more!

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.190
How can you bully
the sick Mew Pudding?!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.400
Sorry, but this has to end now.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:13.410
For the Earth’s future,
I’ll be of service ~Nya!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:17.870
I don’t care if all of you join forces!

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.010
Mew Pudding, are you ok?

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.650
You fought great!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:22.380
Everyone...

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.520
Hey! Don’t waste my time!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:26.210
Attack!!

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.940
(There’s no more rounds)

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:29.170
Fool, hurry up!!

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:30.400
Let’s go!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:31.940
I’m going too!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:33.180
Wait for me!

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:36.610
I want to save Sensei too!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:38.850
I won’t give up!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.270
(Eat this!)

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.480
PuddingRings!!

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:02.580
Reborn... PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:06.470
Ichigo, now!

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.600
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:33.570
(Oh no...)

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:35.430
Just you remember!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.910
I did it, Sensei...

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:43.060
Bu-Ling, hang on!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.110
Oh! Oneechan!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.990
Everyone...

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:05.690
Are you feeling better? You’ve to stay
in bed until you’ve recovered!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.960
Sorry for causing so much trouble!

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.040
From now on we’ll help too!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.130
We will all work together!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.480
Yeeeeeeeesss!

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.280
Oh, you’re awake already?

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:27.770
Bu-Ling-chan... Is something wrong?

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:33.670
Thanks for the food.

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:37.930
Good appetite! You must be feeling better now!

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:41.610
I’m really sorry that you’ve had to do so much for me.

00:18:41.610 --> 00:18:44.180
Not at all. No need to stand on ceremony.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:49.660
You know, I can bring Heicha-chan
to the kindergarten next time.

00:18:52.120 --> 00:18:53.360
No, it’s alright.

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:59.860
I wouldn’t mind that.
This way you can relax a little more.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:06.910
But if you did that, I wouldn’t be able to see you anymore.

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:08.690
Bu-Ling-chan.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:14.400
Instead of that,
may I ask a different favor?

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:15.380
Yes?

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:21.430
Could you, pretend to be
my mom for now?

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.760
Mum...

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.000
Thanks to everyone I’m full of energy again!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:04.360
I can help with all the work now!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.320
OK! Let’s clean up the place
before we open.

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.720
Yes!

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:13.940
Mum...

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:21.640
Bu-Ling is smiling quite fine, right?

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:31.490
It’s terrible! Ichigo and Minto are having a fight!

00:20:31.490 --> 00:20:34.120
Bu-Ling-san don’t look happy?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:38.660
Yes I don’t, because Bu-Ling hate fights!

00:20:38.660 --> 00:20:42.580
Next: “Sparks of the Heart. Ichigo and Minto at odds!”

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:43.870
Thanks for your support!

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:46.620
